# Raw third-party sources: downloaded, not redistributed.
# `make dataset` derives data/catalog/catalog.jsonl from these.
# See DECISIONS.md D-011 and the source table in data/generator/catalog.py.
data/raw/
archive*/
archive*.zip

# Generated.
#
# data/catalog/catalog.jsonl IS committed, deliberately. data/raw/ cannot be
# redistributed (D-011), so without the derived catalog a reviewer could not
# run `make pairs`, `make baseline` or `make eval` on a clean clone -- which
# 06 §6 requires. It is ~230KB of our own derived work in our own schema.
#
# The labelled splits are not committed: 9MB, and `make pairs` regenerates them
# byte-identically from the catalog and the seed.
data/gold/*.jsonl
eval/REPORT.md
